<p>A <code>RedAmberGreenPickerButton</code> is one option inside
  a <a href="/components/red-amber-green-picker/"><code>RedAmberGreenPicker</code></a>.
  Each button is a <code>&lt;button role="radio"&gt;</code> with
  <code>data-status</code> and <code>aria-checked</code>.</p>

<p>See the <a href="/components/red-amber-green-picker/">Picker
  demo</a> for composed examples.</p>

{# BEGIN generated: examples (bin/generate-examples) #}
<h2>Usage</h2>
<pre tabindex="0"><code>{% raw %}&lt;RedAmberGreenPicker label="Project status"&gt;
  &lt;RedAmberGreenPickerButton value="red" label="Red - Critical" onclick={handleSelect} /&gt;
  &lt;RedAmberGreenPickerButton value="amber" label="Amber - Caution" selected onclick={handleSelect} /&gt;
  &lt;RedAmberGreenPickerButton value="green" label="Green - On track" onclick={handleSelect} /&gt;
&lt;/RedAmberGreenPicker&gt;
{% endraw %}</code></pre>
